rp11-build-root/1
exclude /proc kernel-provided mount (HA-1); not a file of the root
exclude /sys kernel-provided mount (HA-1); not a file of the root
exclude /dev device nodes presented by the entry mechanism (HA-3)
exclude /run runtime directory; mounted over by nothing and opened by no class-B or class-E tool (IC-1)
exclude /rp11 the checkout and IC-1 trace mount points; the checkout is a named exclusion (§5.3.2)
